            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A method for producing a protein encoded by a target gene, comprising the step ofexpressing the target gene in a bacterium of the genus Burkholderia, wherein the bacterium lacks one or more genes selected from the group consisting of BSFP_068740, BSFP_068730, and BSFP_068720, or has inhibited expression of the genes or proteins encoded by the genes.</p>
